<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῦκος</span></b> , ὁ, an
		umbelliferous plant growing in Crete, <u>Athamanta</u>
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Cretensis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.72
			</span></i> (who applies the name to two other species, <i>Peucedanum
				Cervaria</i> and <i>Psychotis Amnis),</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1088.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.654
			</span></i>; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταφυλῖνος</span>
			, <i>wild carrot, Daucus Carota,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.862
			</span></i>, which is called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῦκον</span></b> , τό, by <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.5
			</span></i> (but, =
			<i>Malabaila aurea,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.15.8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.20.2
			</span></i>): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαύκειον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				858
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				939
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαυκίν</span></b>  (i.e.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαυκίον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.1.2
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαυχμός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				94
			</span></i> (cf. Sch. ad loc.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Al.</u>
				199
			</span></i>.</div>
